- entry into the protective field
- loss or degradation of required sensing
- invalid localization or operating-domain confidence
- safety-communication timeout
- logic, actuator, brake, or energy-control diagnostic fault
- violation of speed, slope, payload, stopping-distance, or environmental assumptions.
