INTEGRITY_TARGET: Replace with the target derived and justified by the approved method
SAFE_STATE: Traction and hazardous tool motion in the validated safe state with automatic restart inhibited
RESPONSE_TIME: Replace with the total detection-to-safe-state time and subsystem allocations
FAULT_REACTION: Detect specified faults, command the safe state, indicate and retain the fault as required, inhibit automatic restart, and require defined reset conditions and deliberate action.
OWNER: Template safety-function owner
REVIEWER: Replace with competent independent reviewer
REVIEW_DATE: Replace with an ISO 8601 date
